      "body": "Replace the vendored UI tarball with the exact published @nuxtjp/ui 0.1.0 registry dependency, align the published peer requirements, regenerate the pnpm lock and update the package contract assertion.\n\nRemove the obsolete workflow step that invokes pnpm pack before dependency installation. It packs this repository and triggers prepack with ajv unavailable; the public registry dependency no longer requires a vendor archive.\n\nValidation: fresh-store frozen install, compliance verification, 49 tests, typecheck, production build, pack consumer and SSR passed. Independent review and actionlint v1.7.12 passed. Real GitHub policy and verification CI must pass before merge.\n\nOnly package.json, pnpm-lock.yaml, test/layer-contract.test.ts and .github/workflows/verify.yml change. Documentation and user source changes are preserved.",
