      "body": "Readers can see what the repository enables, how to start, and which behavior is implemented. The README and usage guide retain declared dependency prerequisites and distinguish source verification from product or deployment acceptance.\n\nValidation: local Markdown/link checks, source disclosure scan, unchanged license/notice, and existing OSS policy checks where defined. No package publication or deployment is requested.\n\n\nMaintenance resolution: this repository remains archived after source consolidation. The canonical implementation is maintained in nuxtjp/nuxt-declarative-ui. This legacy-only documentation proposal is closed; no legacy release or dependency configuration is reinstated.",
